다는 데 의의가 있다\"며 \"모든 자산군에서 장기적이고 안정적으로 기금 수익을 높여 든든한 노후 소득 보장이 가능하도록 힘쓰겠다\"라고 설명했다.","fetched":true,"url":"https://www.newspim.com/news/view/20260820001251","gurl":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4yMG9IeHpydXFCS00yeUxpaHFINm05WDl0S0xYRVZQTkkwU1JUbzBuTWI2LXUxcmhqampBYVpoZG5mU1FBTE9Ic3pPZTc0NUh5WG5FQnBnZ2RuZ3Rv?oc=5","linkOk":true},{"id":"gkvkdv8","cat":"LP","inst":"수협은행","instType":"은행","asset":"PE","region":"GL","date":"08.20","time":"17:48","ts":"2026-08-20T08:48:00.000Z","source":"SBS Biz","lang":"ko","ko":"수협은행, 인피닛블록 출자로 2대주주…디지털자산 신사업 발굴","en":"","metric":"뉴스","metricLabel":"핵심 지표","ai":["수협은행, 인피닛블록 출자로 2대주주…디지털자산 신사업 발굴 SBS Biz"],"body":"수협은행, 인피닛블록 출자로 2대주주…디지털자산 신사업 발굴 SBS Biz","fetched":false,"url":"https://biz.sbs.co.kr/amp/article/20000329837","gurl":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1Ud2VDSWJscVhzbTJpdGo3bjRxbnd0eHBlTVMwUFNBVXVIdEozamhyeFBkM0pUWU5UWnNUUDFNSVJlX3Y0Y2pNNlVpS1ZWcmY4emZTajN3YXTSAVhBVV95cUxNVHdlQ0libHFYc20yaXRqN240cW53dHhwZU1TMFBTQVV1SHRKM2pocnhQZDNKVFlOVFpzVFAxTUlSZV92NGNqTTZVaUtWVnJmOHpmU2ozd2F0?oc=5","linkOk":true},{"id":"g100nben","cat":"LP","inst":"국민연금","instType":"연기금","asset":"PE","region":"GL","date":"08.20","time":"17:44","ts":"2026-08-20T08:44:00.000Z","source":"네이트","lang":"ko","ko":"국민연금, 대체투자에도 ESG 적용…책임투자 전 자산군으로 확대","en":"","metric":"뉴스","metricLabel":"핵심 지표","ai":["�Ѵ��� ���� ���� : ���� - ���� : �� ���� 08�� 20�� 17:41 �����λ���Ʈ�� ����� ����Դϴ�.���ο��ݰ��� ��ݿ�뺻�� ����.","�Ѱ�DB���ο��ݰ����� å������ ��Ģ�� �ֽ�\\��ä���� �Ѿ� ������ڿ� �ε���, ������ �� ��ü���ڷ� Ȯ��ȴ�.","���ο����� ����ϴ� ��� �ڻ걺���� ESG"],"body":"�Ѵ��� ���� ���� : ���� - ���� : �� ���� 08�� 20�� 17:41 �����λ���Ʈ�� ����� ����Դϴ�.���ο��ݰ��� ��ݿ�뺻�� ����. �Ѱ�DB���ο��ݰ����� å������ ��Ģ�� �ֽ�\\��ä���� �Ѿ� ������ڿ� �ε���, ������ �� ��ü���ڷ� Ȯ��ȴ�. ���ο����� ����ϴ� ��� �ڻ걺���� ESG","fetched":true,"url":"https://news.nate.com/view/20260820n31166","gurl":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTFAxNldRZ0Y4aFpfY2hYbWRtazVLMzY4RF